  "tag_ids": [],
  "policy_sha256": "84f656b16099dcb248866f714453e5bd3e275bdb5d4929c4fad838ee8b29ed2c",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00001",
      "text": "On October 1, when China celebrates National Day, a media stunt by Beijing’s Liaison Office in Hong Kong attracted widespread ridicule online.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "body_start": 0,
      "body_end": 142,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00002",
      "text": "With celebrations of this year's holiday halted in the city due to COVID-19, Beijing distributed a set of packaged National Day news to Hong Kong's media outlets consisting of a muted video, a set of photos and a news story.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "body_start": 144,
      "body_end": 368,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mReXL7_abjY"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00003",
      "text": "The story, published on October 1 by several media outlets, depicted the Liaison Office's director Luo Huining's visiting two supposedly “ordinary” Hong Kong citizens.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "body_start": 370,
      "body_end": 537,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00004",
      "text": "One of them was Ng Pik Han, a 74-year-old resident of Siu Sai Wan who claims to have donated HK$110,000 (US$14,200 dollars) to mainland China earlier in the year when COVID-19 broke out in Wuhan.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "body_start": 539,
      "body_end": 734,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00005",
      "text": "Luo praised Ng’s act as a testament of the connection between Hong Kong and mainland China, using the Chinese expression “blood is thicker than water.” Ng then responds by quoting Luo's own speech from September 30 that “patriotism is not a choice, but an obligation and a righteous path.”",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "body_start": 736,
      "body_end": 1025,
      "source_links": [
        "https://hk.appledaily.com/news/20200930/UXIRJVXCXVAFVAWGJXYZWF2P7U/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00006",
      "text": "The other interviewee was Xu Tianmin, a man who lives in an 8-square-meter apartment in the Shum Shui Po complex. Xu says in the video that, because he's unemployed, his wife and daughter have had no choice but to return to their hometown in Hunan province.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 6,
      "body_start": 1027,
      "body_end": 1284,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00007",
      "text": "Luo then comments on how the protests and the pandemic have struck Hong Kong's economy, and proceeds to tell his staff to help Xu find a new job.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 7,
      "body_start": 1286,
      "body_end": 1431,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00008",
      "text": "Pro-Beijing newspaper Wen Wei Po published on October 1 a separate interview with Xu, who then said he helped organize pro-China protests since June 2019, when the anti-extradition demonstrations broke out, and that he had spent about HK$ 100,000 (about US$13,000 dollars) to help clean up anti-China graffiti and posters from the streets.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 8,
      "body_start": 1433,
      "body_end": 1772,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.wenweipo.com/a/202010/01/AP5f75943fe4b04dd69b39028e.html"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00009",
      "text": "Netizens were quick to question Xu's identity.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 9,
      "body_start": 1774,
      "body_end": 1820,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00010",
      "text": "While a cropped photo briefly led some to wrongfully conclude that he was a reporter from Beijing, soon it became clear that he was indeed a pro-China protester who had been interviewed by mainland Chinese and pro-Beijing media outlets in Hong Kong multiple times in the past.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 10,
      "body_start": 1822,
      "body_end": 2098,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.facebook.com/permalink.php?story_fbid=3331227590246461&id=301049249930992"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00011",
      "text": "@Lazyyyyyyy is among the netizens who dig into the story:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 11,
      "body_start": 2100,
      "body_end": 2157,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00012",
      "text": "On October 2, Wen Wei Po published another interview with Xu on its front page. This time, Xu said he had donated nearly one million Hong Kong dollars (US$130,000 dollars) earlier this year to mainland China for COVID-19 relief. The story stressed that Xu’s act reflected the spirit of Luo’s speech on “patriotism is not a choice, but an obligation”.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 12,
      "body_start": 2159,
      "body_end": 2509,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.wenweipo.com/a/202010/02/AP5f764585e4b04dd69b391069.html"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00013",
      "text": "The search for Xu’s real identity has triggered a large number of comments and jokes on the Hong Kon internet. Below are some picks from various public pages on Facebook:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 13,
      "body_start": 2511,
      "body_end": 2681,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00014",
      "text": "> 連基層也是山寨",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 14,
      "body_start": 2683,
      "body_end": 2692,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00015",
      "text": "> Faking the grassroots.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 15,
      "body_start": 2694,
      "body_end": 2718,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00016",
      "text": "> 沒維穩費要一人分飾多角",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 16,
      "body_start": 2720,
      "body_end": 2733,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00017",
      "text": "> One actor has to take up multiple roles, the stability maintenance fund has been used up.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 17,
      "body_start": 2735,
      "body_end": 2826,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00018",
      "text": "> 好撚煩，成鳩日做戲，同電話騙案一鳩樣，已經冇人上當㗎啦，都要做",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 18,
      "body_start": 2828,
      "body_end": 2861,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00019",
      "text": "> That kind of drama is like telephone scams, no one believes in them but they keep the show on.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 19,
      "body_start": 2863,
      "body_end": 2959,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00020",
      "text": "> 其他愛國藍絲應該好好學習!賣左層樓奉獻畀國家!唔係點配得上愛國呢2粒字!",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 20,
      "body_start": 2961,
      "body_end": 2999,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00021",
      "text": "> Establishment supporters should learn this. Sell their apartment, donate it to the country or they can't be a patriot.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 21,
      "body_start": 3001,
      "body_end": 3121,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00022",
      "text": "> 蘇聯作家、諾貝爾獎得主索忍尼辛：「我們知道他們在說謊，他們也知道自己是說謊，他們也知道我們知道他們在說謊，我們也知道他們知道我們知道他們說謊，但是他們依然在說謊。」",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 22,
      "body_start": 3123,
      "body_end": 3207,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-720505-b00023",
      "text": "> Russian writer and Nobel Prize laureate Aleksandr Solzhenitsyn [editor's note: widely circulated unverified quote]: “We know they’re lying, they know they’re lying, they know that we know they’re lying, we also know that they know that we know they’re lying, but they still lie.“",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 23,
      "body_start": 3209,
      "body_end": 3490,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    }
  ],
